*> PLB-K012 abstime-not-packed: a CICS ABSTIME item that is not eight
*> bytes of packed decimal.
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. ABSTIME.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  WS-TIME-BINARY      PIC S9(18) COMP.
01  WS-TIME-SHORT       PIC S9(8) COMP-3.
01  WS-TIME-DISPLAY     PIC 9(15).
01  WS-ABSTIME          PIC S9(15) COMP-3.
01  WS-DATE             PIC X(10).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    *> Reported: binary, too short, and display.
    EXEC CICS ASKTIME ABSTIME(WS-TIME-BINARY) END-EXEC
    EXEC CICS ASKTIME ABSTIME(WS-TIME-SHORT) END-EXEC
    EXEC CICS FORMATTIME ABSTIME(WS-TIME-DISPLAY) YYYYMMDD(WS-DATE)
    END-EXEC
    *> Not reported: PIC S9(15) COMP-3.
    EXEC CICS ASKTIME ABSTIME(WS-ABSTIME) END-EXEC
    EXEC CICS FORMATTIME ABSTIME(WS-ABSTIME) YYYYMMDD(WS-DATE)
    END-EXEC
    GOBACK.
